	"FriendlyName": "HVP Primitive Data",
	"Description": "Name your custom primitive data once, in a Primitive Data Index asset. Bound materials have their parameters' slot numbers written for them, and the Set Indexed Primitive Data node picks parameters by name - its value pin becomes a scalar or a colour to match. The node compiles down to the engine's own SetCustomPrimitiveData calls with the slot baked in, so nothing from this plugin exists in a packaged build.",
